{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "bebb5bde-585c-85d9-91dd-af488fc2ab17",
  "created_at": "2026-02-27T12:01:30-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Luz Figueroa",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:56:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Good morning, well, almost afternoon. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:56:28-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, good morning. I'm calling about a manhole cover that's sunk down in the road. I'm on speaker, I hope you can hear me okay, I've got my hands full."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:56:41-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. A manhole cover that's sunk, okay. Where is this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:56:48-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's right in front of 423 Bellevue Avenue. That's my mother's house. I'm calling for her, she's in her seventies and she doesn't do the phone much anymore."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:57:00-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 423 Bellevue Avenue. Let me write that down. And the cover is in the street, not on the sidewalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:57:09-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "In the street, yeah, kind of toward the edge of the lane on the side by her driveway. The cover itself dropped down below the pavement, so there's a dip all around it. And every time a car goes over it, it rings. Like a clang, bong, [pause] you can hear it in the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:57:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's loose, it rattles or rings when the tires hit it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:57:38-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Rings is the word. Like somebody hit a pot with a spoon. Hang on one second. [pause] Sorry, I've got the baby strapped to my chest in the carrier and she's fussing. She's fine, she's just not a fan of me standing still."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:57:56-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, no worries at all. Take your time. Is the hole around the cover big?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:58:03-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's about, I don't know, a foot or so of dip around it, and right now it's full of water. That's the part that bothers me. With the water in it you can't really see how deep it is. A car can hit it without knowing, and somebody on a bike would really get thrown."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:58:26-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So the sunken area around the manhole is filled with water and hard to see. Let me repeat that back. 423 Bellevue Avenue, manhole cover sunk below the road surface, rings when vehicles go over it, and water is pooled in the depression so it's hard to see. Did I get it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:58:48-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it exactly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:58:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is it the whole cover that's sunk, or just one side?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:58:55-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[crosstalk] Sorry, go ahead. I'd say mostly the whole thing, but the side toward the middle of the road is lower. That's the side that clangs."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:59:06-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, the street side is lower. And I'll note it's on the lane next to the house. Is there anything marking it right now, a cone or anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:59:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, nothing. My mother put a trash barrel near it yesterday and the wind knocked it over. So no."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:59:27-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll send this over to the crew as a road hazard, and they'll go out and take a look. Depending on whether it's a city cover or a utility one, it may get passed along to whoever owns it, but we'll handle that part."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:59:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Can I get a reference number? So if I call back I can say what it was."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:59:54-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Let me finish entering it. [pause] Okay, I'm putting it in now. Do you want me to use your number for the callback, or your mother's?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:00:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Use mine. It's 401-555-0180."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:00:09-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-oh. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:00:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Luz Figueroa. L-U-Z, then Figueroa, F-I-G-U-E-R-O-A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:00:15-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Luz. Okay, the system gave me the reference. It's PW, dash, two-six, dash, zero-four-one-seven. Want me to read that again slowly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:00:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes please, hold on, let me grab a pen. [pause] Okay, go."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:00:31-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "P as in Peter, W as in William. Dash. Two, six. Dash. Zero, four, one, seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:00:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "PW, two-six, zero-four-one-seven. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:00:41-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. If the water drains or gets worse, or you see anyone hit it, call us back and give that number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:00:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Should my mother do anything in the meantime? Like put something out there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:00:58-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I wouldn't have her go out in the road. If she wants to, she can keep an eye on it from the window, and you can call us if it changes. I've marked it as a hazard so it goes to the front of the list for the crew."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:01:18-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. That works. Thanks, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:01:21-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Hope the little one settles down. Have a good weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T12:01:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
